this &amp;quot;constitutional&amp;quot; issue!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5155410703020993486/comments/default/7512391495330825265'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5155410703020993486/comments/default/7512391495330825265'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/07/obamacare-and-revenge-of-secret.html?showComment=1342750950624#c7512391495330825265' title=''/><author><name>DL.</name><uri>http://itsafluffy.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/07/obamacare-and-revenge-of-secret.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5155410703020993486' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5155410703020993486' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1065682367"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 19, 2012 at 8:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5406221146078558239</id><published>2012-07-19T19:43:35.339-06:00</published><updated>2012-07-19T19:43:35.339-06:00</updated><title type='text'>What else can I say, Will?&#xa;&#xa;Damn you, Alexander Ha...</title><content type='html'>What else can I say, Will?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Damn you, Alexander Hamilton!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;GOD DAMNED YOU!!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5155410703020993486/comments/default/5406221146078558239'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5155410703020993486/comments/default/5406221146078558239'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/htm